This is all I did:

Use netinfo manager to create a games user with group id 20 (staff)
    I copied an existing user, changed uid and all the names, set gid=20
Edit config.h, set the defines for COMPRESS to use /usr/bin/gzip.
Run sys/unix/setup.sh
Edit src/Makefile to use WINTTYLIB = -lncurses
In top directory:

make all
sudo make install

Poof... a compiled ASCII nethack that works just great on my ibook

